   281	so the author reads them from that output without opening the bundle. **Cost after H4:** before the protocol is written, the
   282	cost table (8.2) is recomputed with H4 priced from that measurement (scaled to the benchmark's pod timing); if the
   283	evaluation cap is exceeded, the cuts of 8.2 apply in their order. The
   284	author records the bundle hash in protocol v2 and does not read the bundle until the report. The evaluation code loads H4
   285	from the bundle after the lock and before any evaluation-seed episode, and verifies the hash. No repair is allowed after
